              "name": "prompt",
              "value": "=Create a photorealistic image of a 4–6 month old baby wearing the exact dress from the provided image, preserving the original color, texture, pattern, and fit. Scene & Pose:  Front-facing camera angle Baby is lying flat on their back (supine position) on a bed Baby is not sitting, standing, or propped up Appearance & Expression:  Baby is wearing only the extracted dress, correctly fitted Both hands are covered with white baby mittens Mittens are simple pocket-style gloves (no individual finger separations) Baby is looking toward the camera Calm, gentle, natural facial expression Environment & Lighting:  Soft, neutral-colored bedding Natural, realistic lighting Highly realistic skin texture and fabric detail The final image should look like a real-life photograph, not an illustration or stylized render.",
